{
  "name": "01 \u2014 KB Sync (Products + Setup \u2192 Pinecone, Gemini + validation)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1 v4 \u2014 KB Sync with Gemini credential validation\n\n**Important \u2014 Gemini credential setup:**\n1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and create an API key.\n2. In n8n: Credentials -> New -> 'Google Gemini (PaLM) API' -> select **'My own credential'** (NOT n8n Connect) -> paste key.\n3. Open the **Gemini Embeddings** and **Validate Gemini Embeddings** nodes in this workflow and bind that credential.\n\n**Pre-flight validation:** every run first calls Gemini's `embedContent` for `gemini-embedding-001` once. If the response is not a 3072-dim vector, **Stop and Error** halts the workflow before Pinecone is touched, so you'll see the failure clearly.\n\n**If Gemini still fails:**\n- Disable the `Gemini Embeddings` node.\n- Enable the `OpenAI Embeddings (fallback)` node.\n- Wire its `ai_embedding` output into `Pinecone Upsert`.\n- Recreate Pinecone index `fb-chatbot-kb` at dim **1536** (cosine).\n- Apply the same swap in Workflow 2.\n\n**Pinecone:** index `fb-chatbot-kb` (dim 3072 with Gemini, cosine), namespace `knowledge`, `clearNamespace=true`.\n**Tabs read:** Products, Setup. **Never read:** Users, Orders, Leads.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 540
      },
      "id": "1de9dd3d-5bc1-422e-b3e6-8231bce2eab8",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e2cf8fef-b9c3-4887-851f-d06d3aaa25b0",
      "name": "Run Manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 3 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9f76801f-faa6-4af5-a641-322e1a3603d6",
      "name": "Daily Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-embedding-001:embedContent",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googlePalmApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"content\": { \"parts\": [{\"text\": \"n8n embedding self-test\"}] },\n  \"outputDimensionality\": 3072\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "2ff0ea88-2ba4-4a01-b47d-c1c0923be519",
      "name": "Validate Gemini Embeddings",
